d886c6322c9b4f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/66cd26b2/uploads/origins/64631db4-92db-49a1-841b-60573056796e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=de0d5b7c8a9e0269aed886c6322c9b4f, https://si.imgix.net/66cd26b2/uploads/origins/64631db4-92db-49a1-841b-60573056796e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e3cd7c655ca01ee95df0f49b29207498 2x, https://si.imgix.net/66cd26b2/uploads/origins/64631db4-92db-49a1-841b-60573056796e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a8a066e9528eaf80056f22db38ae4f22 3x"}, "body": "Hello again!\n\nAmazing work on the last three. Here's a funny / scary one!\n\nIn this piece I would like the three minion characters looming over a freshly baked pie, with the white haired lady looming over the three of them with a threatening expression.\n\nA few notes on expressions to try:\nWoman: threatening, scary, does not want them to steal her pie\nJacket wearing minion: Victorious, aggressive\nBow wearing minion: euphorically joyful, mouth-watering bliss\nGlasses wearing minion: weary, sensing a nearby danger\n\nthank you!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1pTvDdh1iZ0SGV9pn41BCxzuE6Lcx6sfg?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1pTvDdh1iZ0SGV9pn41BCxzuE6Lcx6sfg?usp=sharing", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mitu124521821/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2191030, "client_id": 2553501, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9dd0d87c/uploads/origins/401df3d9-5530-46d7-adac-7d118046f12f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=41b075915dae73451c7368d2484d466a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9dd0d87c/uploads/origins/401df3d9-5530-46d7-adac-7d118046f12f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=41b075915dae73451c7368d2484d466a, https://si.imgix.net/9dd0d87c/uploads/origins/401df3d9-5530-46d7-adac-7d118046f12f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6103518259e31340bc9d79b3050163b1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9dd0d87c/uploads/origins/401df3d9-5530-46d7-adac-7d118046f12f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=15077450688833f33347366ca6505305 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9dd0d87c/uploads/origins/401df3d9-5530-46d7-adac-7d118046f12f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d61d1a19055e47eab9663cce58f52942", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9dd0d87c/uploads/origins/401df3d9-5530-46d7-adac-7d118046f12f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d61d1a19055e47eab9663cce58f52942, https://si.imgix.net/9dd0d87c/uploads/origins/401df3d9-5530-46d7-adac-7d118046f12f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2e0dfec6cb58224993906e490b47192d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9dd0d87c/uploads/origins/401df3d9-5530-46d7-adac-7d118046f12f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=01ce788461c46e162965cc1b9e8cc4df 3x"}, "body": "Thanks for another great piece!\n\nThis next one, I'd love to have Overlord Chaos (1) and Lord Knight Order (2) dancing a waltz in a ballroom.\nChaos should be grinning and having a wonderful time, 2 should have a flat expression - it's not clear how she's feeling about this.\n\nFrom the sidelines please place Knight Justice (3) and Scout Minion (4) watching them in horror.\nJustice should have a nice suit one\nScout Minion can have a bow or something fancy to show they are also at the party.\n\nThank you very much for your help!\n\n-Other translation follows-\n\nまた素晴らしい作品をありがとうございます！\n\n次の作品では、オーバーロード・カオス（1）とロード・ナイト・オーダー（2）が舞踏会でワルツを踊っている様子を描いていただきたいです。\n\nカオスは満面の笑みで楽しそうにしている様子、2は無表情で、この状況をどう感じているのかはっきりしない様子を描いてください。\n\n傍らには、ナイト・ジャスティス（3）とスカウト・ミニオン（4）が、恐怖の表情で二人を見守っている様子を描いてください。\n\nジャスティスは素敵なスーツを着ている姿でお願いします。\nスカウト・ミニオンには、パーティーに参加していることを示すために、リボンか何か装飾品を付けてください。\n\nご協力ありがとうございます！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/165uzhw9y67ZjxwuPKeit3bTAlHnrOcqc?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/165uzhw9y67ZjxwuPKeit3bTAlHnrOcqc?usp=sharing", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mitu124521821/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2191030, "client_id": 1040600, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/03c0a8f3/uploads/origins/1f3a40e0-3bb1-428d-b404-db7970b53630?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c716ec6beb5a6339687245c53fade5de", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/03c0a8f3/uploads/origins/1f3a40e0-3bb1-428d-b404-db7970b53630?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c716ec6beb5a6339687245c53fade5de, https://si.imgix.net/03c0a8f3/uploads/origins/1f3a40e0-3bb1-428d-b404-db7970b53630?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1485f4f5e4bdff822b1a735cf092f2bc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/03c0a8f3/uploads/origins/1f3a40e0-3bb1-428d-b404-db7970b53630?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=db03d0c711b4438c9fb52eb52bf4fc98 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/03c0a8f3/uploads/origins/1f3a40e0-3bb1-428d-b404-db7970b53630?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e78637495f0e82eb869b93937ecbec13", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/03c0a8f3/uploads/origins/1f3a40e0-3bb1-428d-b404-db7970b53630?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=w